===== [rs0_init] rs_initiate
rs.initiate({
  _id: "rs0",
  members: [
    { _id: 0, host: "mongo1:27017", priority: 2 },
    { _id: 1, host: "mongo2:27017", priority: 1 },
    { _id: 2, host: "mongo3:27017", priority: 1 }
  ]
})
----->
{
  ok: 1,
  '$clusterTime': {
    clusterTime: Timestamp({ t: 1791185613, i: 1 }),
    signature: {
      hash: Binary.createFromBase64('AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=', 0),
      keyId: Long('0')
    }
  },
  operationTime: Timestamp({ t: 1791185613, i: 1 })
}

===== [rs0_init] _wait
sleep(12000)
----->


